{{!--
Fallback body for a combined PR of three or more similar changes when the target repository has no template.
Read references/combined-pr.md first; repository template rules win.
attentionItems: list with item (update name and source PR) and note (one or two plain sentences on the behavior change, migration, release note, or hold); leave out when nothing needs a decision
updates: list with pr (source PR references), update (name and from → to), impact (one line), risk (Low, Medium, or High)
sharedCaveat: optional one line that applies to every included update
beforeMerging: list of checks the maintainer must confirm, including checks not run in the agent's environment
validationSummary: one line on checks that ran and their outcome across the bundle, such as "Focused tests pass for all 8 updates; full suites not run here"
notIncluded: optional; leave out when every update is included. Fields: held (list with pr and reason), failed (list with pr and reason), inProgress (list with pr and reason; still being worked on, such as a pending regeneration or retry, and expected in a later combined PR)
issueLinks: list of confirmed lines such as closes #123 or refs owner/repo#456
validationByUpdate: list with pr, checks (what ran), and outcome; use observed results only
notRun: checks not run with reasons, or None
--}}
